                                               moves ≈ 48·tsteps·n²               if ≈ 48·n² ≥ M and ≈ 32·n < M and ≈ 96·n < M
                                               moves ≈ 64·tsteps·n²               if ≈ 64·n² ≥ M and ≈ 32·n < M and ≈ 96·n ≥ M
                 lower bound      moves 16·n² − 64·n + 64            (footprint, every distinct element crosses once)   gap 4× if ≈ 64·n² < M and ≈ 32·n ≥ M; 3× if ≈ 48·n² < M and ≈ 32·n < M and ≈ 96·n < M; 4× if ≈ 64·n² < M and ≈ 32·n < M and ≈ 96·n ≥ M at M = 2 MiB, B = 64
                 footprint        a: [0, 8·a.len()) (whole array)  b: [0, 8·b.len()) (whole array)   no residue claimed
